\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\title{The two-cell circle and its field reflection}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{On a circle with two edges, a reflection can exchange the
vertices while fixing both edges as unoriented cells. Cochain
coefficients on those edges must account for the reversed
orientation and the change of source. This determines a field
reflection on the full paired exterior algebra.}

